   "script_line": "Second lever: sleep. It is the strongest wellbeing determinant of a stay, almost always compromised by operational causes, not design. Total blackout verified, not assumed. Maintenance noise at an agreed hour. Night-time quiet explained warmly on arrival, not as a house rule. And never knocking on a door before ten in the morning without an express request. People who sleep well forgive almost anything; people who sleep badly forgive nothing — and the reason given in the review is rarely sleep.",
